@startuml packages
' Hand-maintained. Enforced for real by rest/src/test/java/ArchitectureTest.java (ArchUnit)
title Logical architecture — one Maven reactor, three modules, one bootable jar

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

package "rest  (mu.server.rest)" as REST #E8F0FE {
  [Application] <<@SpringBootApplication>>
  [controller] <<@RestController>>
  [config] <<@Configuration>>
  [filter] <<OncePerRequestFilter>>
  [advice] <<@RestControllerAdvice>>
}

package "service  (mu.server.service)" as SVC #E6F4EA {
  [Service API] <<interface>>
  [impl] <<*ServiceImpl>>
  [mapper] <<MapStruct>>
  [dto] <<record / data class>>
  [http] <<@HttpExchange>>
  [exception]
}

package "persistence  (mu.server.persistence)" as PERS #FEF7E0 {
  [entity] <<@Entity>>
  [repository] <<Spring Data>>
  [repository.blaze] <<entity views>>
  [enumeration] <<Role / Permission>>
  [audit] <<Auditable>>
  [converter] <<AES @Convert>>
}

cloud "Keycloak" as KC
database "MySQL" as DB
cloud "JSONPlaceholder" as JP

[controller] --> [Service API]
[impl] ..|> [Service API]
[impl] --> [repository]
[impl] --> [mapper]
[impl] --> [http]
[mapper] --> [entity]
[repository] --> [entity]

[config] --> KC : Keycloak admin client
[filter] --> [dto]
[advice] --> [exception]
[http] --> JP : RestClient + @Retryable
[repository] --> DB : JPA / Blaze
REST --> KC : JWT resource server\n+ OAuth2 login

note bottom of PERS
  **ArchUnit rules (ArchitectureTest):**
  • controller: accessed by NO layer
  • service: only from controller / config / advice / filter
  • persistence: only from service / config / controller
  • persistence must NOT depend on service or controller
  • every public *ServiceImpl method is @Transactional
    (except fallback* / authenticate)
  • @Service under ..service.., @Entity under ..persistence..
end note

note top of REST
  Only **rest** is bootable: spring-boot-maven-plugin
  is skip=true in the root pom and re-enabled here.
  Kotlin and Java share src/main/java in every module.
end note

footer docs/packages.puml — Bigorno12/monolith-architecture
@enduml
